. It has grilled chicken with lettuce, tomato, and BACON JAM. The breakfast is good. I am pretty simple when it comes to breakfast so I haven't venture to more of the unique items. The coffee is French Truck Coffee so that's another plus in my book. The grilled cheese is good with the tomato soup. Not so big on the chicken salad, a little dry and not sweet enough (maybe missing some grapes or something). It was confusing if it was supposed to be savory or sweet. I could go on and on. Overall, the experience is amazing, there is a ..."},{"business_id":"WRFhNoO4W3-KK9tDBv49wQ","review_id":"HX_-NTD1C7nhu5OOeHwbBA","date":"2018-07-28T03:22:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9121578931808472,"text_excerpt":"Probably one of the places I frequent most for lunch. The salads are huge so you may want to get the dressing on the side because I always have to bring half of it back to the office to eat. During the winter I love to get the grilled cheese, salad, and soup offering. If you are a friend of blue truck coffee you should stop by blue line because they have it readily available."},{"business_id":"WRFhNoO4W3-KK9tDBv49wQ","review_id":"2oqjsO6xYJBHpbQjf1Wjpw","date":"2018-02-05T04:13:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9009866714477539,"text_excerpt":"Visited Blue Line for the first time this morning. Delicious, high quality ingredients, carefully prepared by a friendly staff. We definitely will be back."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
